    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving an SOS signal from the research complex &quot;Vostok,&quot; a brave polar explorer from the &quot;Mirny&quot; station rushes to the rescue. But what secrets are hidden behind the locked doors of this Antarctic base? Why did communication stop, and where did all the staff disappear? In &quot;The Black Ice&quot;, the protagonist must uncover many mysteries, face dangerous enemies, and keep his sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/b91bbb5a2900b51ad2d87d111f14af14.poster.avif?t=1746293710\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/b91bbb5a2900b51ad2d87d111f14af14.webm?t=1746293710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/b91bbb5a2900b51ad2d87d111f14af14.mp4?t=1746293710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is named after a rare geological phenomenon that forms under extreme conditions deep within Antarctic ice. This ice appears unusually black, possibly due to foreign particles of unknown, possibly cosmic, origin within its structure. For instance, traces of meteorite dust or other exotic materials that reached Earth millions of years ago and became trapped within glacial layers may be found here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/19559050d5073a775860820d58ed5692.poster.avif?t=1746293710\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/19559050d5073a775860820d58ed5692.webm?t=1746293710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/19559050d5073a775860820d58ed5692.mp4?t=1746293710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror with an oppressive atmosphere of loneliness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex full of puzzles and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited ammunition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time as your ultimate enemy</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving an SOS signal from the research complex &quot;Vostok,&quot; a brave polar explorer from the &quot;Mirny&quot; station rushes to the rescue. But what secrets are hidden behind the locked doors of this Antarctic base? Why did communication stop, and where did all the staff disappear? In &quot;The Black Ice&quot;, the protagonist must uncover many mysteries, face dangerous enemies, and keep his sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/b91bbb5a2900b51ad2d87d111f14af14.poster.avif?t=1746293710\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/b91bbb5a2900b51ad2d87d111f14af14.webm?t=1746293710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/b91bbb5a2900b51ad2d87d111f14af14.mp4?t=1746293710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is named after a rare geological phenomenon that forms under extreme conditions deep within Antarctic ice. This ice appears unusually black, possibly due to foreign particles of unknown, possibly cosmic, origin within its structure. For instance, traces of meteorite dust or other exotic materials that reached Earth millions of years ago and became trapped within glacial layers may be found here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/19559050d5073a775860820d58ed5692.poster.avif?t=1746293710\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/19559050d5073a775860820d58ed5692.webm?t=1746293710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254050/extras/19559050d5073a775860820d58ed5692.mp4?t=1746293710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror with an oppressive atmosphere of loneliness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex full of puzzles and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited ammunition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time as your ultimate enemy</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In a remote and mysterious research facility in Antarctica, an intense atmosphere of fear and death hangs in the air. In horror &quot;The Black Ice&quot;, players find themselves exploring this haunting place alone, solving puzzles and fighting to stay alive as they face the chilling unknown.",
